      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Industrial Profile of Dadra & Nagar Haveli"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Dadra & Nagar Haveli's economy relies heavily on manufacturing industries, notably textiles, plastics, electronics, and pharmaceuticals, with Silvassa as its main industrial hub.",
        "Daman and Diu's economy is primarily driven by tourism, fisheries, pharmaceuticals, distilleries, and coastal commercial activities.",
        "The official merger of Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu into a single Union Territory took effect on 26th January 2020.",
        "Strategic proximity to NH-48 and major industrial corridors in Gujarat and Maharashtra significantly enhances the region's connectivity and economic output."
      ],
      "id": "8z2rfvq"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cwiwerq"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "The economic landscape of Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu is characterized by rapid manufacturing growth, strong connectivity, and thriving coastal tourism.",
